From 9518cdcf3b7170417a2fd0ed6a7dfcd1893ecd56 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: HybridGt <hybridgt@localhost>
Date: Tue, 24 Nov 2026 18:02:45 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 01/14] Shaders: wave64 emulation on 32-lane hosts
 (VICTORY_WAVE64_EMULATE), Agility SDK opt-in

From GTA6-PC-Native (github.com/ZigZagBoi1/GTA6-PC-Native) at 05b9566,
patches/victory-01-wave64-emulation-and-agility-sdk.patch, GPL-3.0-or-later;
applied with CRLF stripped, one hunk re-placed by hand (v_readfirstlane
and its test, upstream moved), emulate_wave64: false added to three newer
test initializers. NVIDIA GPUs run 32-lane waves: translated wave64
compute programs declare WaveSize(64), which they refuse, and wave64
cross-lane logic in mesh/pixel programs is wrong there.
victory-shader: 121 passed, 1 ignored.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
